/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the anatomy and structural organization of an ANSI C program with an annotated code listing.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Structural Architecture of an ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   An ANSI C program consists of structured sections arranged logically from global directives to) Tj
T*
(   functional execution:) Tj
T*
(   1. Documentation and Header Inclusions:) Tj
T*
(   - Preprocessor directives \(#include\) copy standard library function declarations and header) Tj
T*
(   prototypes.) Tj
T*
(   2. Symbolic Constants and Macro Definitions:) Tj
T*
(   - Defined via #define to establish maintainable configuration parameters without runtime) Tj
T*
(   overhead.) Tj
T*
(   3. Global Declarations and Type Definitions:) Tj
T*
(   - External variable definitions and custom composite types \(typedef, struct\) accessible across) Tj
T*
(   functions.) Tj
T*
(   4. Main Execution Function:) Tj
T*
(   - Entry point: int main\(int argc, char *argv[]\). Must return an integer exit status \(0 =) Tj
T*
(   success\).) Tj
T*
