(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the complete four-stage C compilation pipeline \(Preprocessing, Compilation, Assembly, Linking\) with GCC flags.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Four-Stage C Compilation Pipeline:) Tj
T*
(   The translation of human-readable C source code into machine-executable binary involves four) Tj
T*
(   sequential subsystems:) Tj
T*
(   1. Preprocessing Stage \(cpp - C Preprocessor\):) Tj
T*
(   - Command: gcc -E source.c -o source.i) Tj
T*
(   - Responsibilities:) Tj
T*
(   a. Strips all source comments \(/* */ and //\).) Tj
T*
(   b. Expands header files included via #include by pasting their literal contents.) Tj
T*
(   c. Replaces symbolic macros \(#define\) with their designated replacement tokens.) Tj
T*
(   d. Evaluates conditional compilation directives \(#ifdef, #ifndef, #endif\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Compilation / Translation Stage \(cc1 - Compiler Proper\):) Tj
T*
(   - Command: gcc -S source.i -o source.s) Tj
T*
(   - Responsibilities:) Tj
T*
(   a. Lexical Analysis: Tokenizes preprocessed stream.) Tj
T*
(   b. Syntax & Semantic Analysis: Generates Abstract Syntax Tree \(AST\), validates type checking.) Tj
T*
(   c. Code Optimization: Register allocation, loop unrolling, dead-code elimination.) Tj
T*
(   d. Assembly Generation: Produces architecture-specific assembly language text \(.s\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Assembly Stage \(as - Assembler\):) Tj
T*
ET

