(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the concept of C Tokens and categorize the five primary token types with illustrative examples.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Classification of C Tokens:) Tj
T*
(   A token is the smallest individual lexical unit recognized by the compiler during lexical) Tj
T*
(   analysis. Whitespace and comments are ignored except as token delimiters.) Tj
T*
(   C tokens are categorized into five fundamental groups:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Keywords \(Reserved Words\):) Tj
T*
(   - Built-in reserved terms with hardcoded semantic meanings in C. Cannot be repurposed as user) Tj
T*
(   variables.) Tj
T*
(   - Examples: int, float, double, return, if, else, for, while, struct, sizeof.) Tj
T*
(   2. Identifiers \(User-Defined Names\):) Tj
T*
(   - Names assigned by programmers to variables, functions, arrays, structures, and labels.) Tj
T*
(   - Lexical Rules: Must begin with an alphabetic letter [a-z, A-Z] or underscore \(_\). Can be) Tj
T*
(   followed by alphanumeric characters. Case-sensitive.) Tj
T*
(   - Examples: dna_sequence, _temp_val, calculate_gc, proteinLength.) Tj
T*
(   3. Constants \(Literals\):) Tj
T*
(   - Fixed values that remain immutable throughout program execution.) Tj
T*
(   - Integer Constants: 100, 075 \(octal\), 0xFF \(hexadecimal\).) Tj
T*
(   - Floating-Point Constants: 3.14159, 6.022e23, 1.5f.) Tj
T*
(   - Character Constants: 'A', '\\n', '\\0'.) Tj
T*
(   - String Literals: "Biotechnology", "ATG-Codon".) Tj
T*
(   4. Operators:) Tj
T*
(   - Symbols that instruct the compiler to perform mathematical, relational, bitwise, or logical) Tj
T*
(   manipulations.) Tj
T*
(   - Examples: +, -, *, /, %, ==, !=, &&, ||, &, |, ^, <<, >>, sizeof.) Tj
T*
(   5. Special Characters / Delimiters \(Punctuators\):) Tj
T*
(   - Syntactical separators organizing code structure:) Tj
T*
(   Semicolons \(;\): Terminates statements.) Tj
T*
(   Braces \({ }\): Enclose compound blocks and function bodies.) Tj
T*
(   Parentheses \(\( \)\): Group expressions and parameter lists.) Tj
T*
(   Square Brackets \([ ]\): Array subscript indexing.) Tj
T*
(   Comma \(,\): Separates parameters or expressions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
