T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Type Qualifiers: const and volatile:) Tj
T*
(   Type qualifiers modify the access permissions and compiler optimization assumptions applied to) Tj
T*
(   variables.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. The const Qualifier:) Tj
T*
(   - Semantics: Declares a read-only variable whose value cannot be reassigned through its) Tj
T*
(   identifier after initialization.) Tj
T*
(   - Enforcement: Enforced by compiler during syntax checking.) Tj
T*
(   - Placement:) Tj
T*
