(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Explicit Type Casting with code demonstrating floating-point division correction and pointer conversion.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Explicit Type Casting in C:) Tj
T*
(   Explicit type casting allows programmers to override default compiler typing rules using the) Tj
T*
(   cast operator: \(target_type\)expression.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Syntax and Precedence:) Tj
T*
(   - Syntax: \(type_name\) expression) Tj
T*
(   - Precedence: Level 2 \(Unary, Right-to-Left associativity\).) Tj
T*
(   - Cast creates an anonymous temporary rvalue of the target type without mutating the original) Tj
T*
(   variable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Application 1: Resolving Integer Division Truncation:) Tj
T*
(   In C, dividing two integers performs integer division, discarding fractional components:) Tj
T*
(   int sum = 17, count = 5;) Tj
T*
(   double avg_broken = sum / count; /* 17 / 5 evaluates to 3; avg_broken = 3.0 */) Tj
T*
(   double avg_fixed = \(double\)sum / count; /* \(double\)17 is 17.0; 17.0 / 5 evaluates to 3.4 */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Application 2: Pointer Conversion \(Generic void*\):) Tj
T*
(   Dynamic memory allocators return void* generic pointers that must be converted or assigned) Tj
T*
(   safely:) Tj
T*
(   double *data_buffer = \(double *\)malloc\(100 * sizeof\(double\)\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Demonstrative ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
