(   5. Type Consistency Rule:) Tj
T*
(   Both the true and false branches must evaluate to compatible data types. If types differ,) Tj
T*
(   implicit arithmetic promotion is applied to normalize the return type:) Tj
T*
(   double res = \(flag\) ? 5 : 3.14; /* 5 is promoted to double 5.0 */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   6. Hardware and Performance Optimization:) Tj
T*
(   Modern pipelined microprocessors utilize branch prediction. An if-else construct may suffer) Tj
T*
(   branch misprediction penalties \(~15-20 CPU cycles\).) Tj
T*
(   Compilers frequently translate the ternary operator into conditional move instructions \(CMOV on) Tj
T*
(   x86, CSEL on ARM\), eliminating branch mispredictions entirely.) Tj
T*
() Tj
