/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to convert temperatures across Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin scales with input validation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Multi-Scale Temperature Converter with Robust Validation:) Tj
T*
(   1. Conversion Formulas:) Tj
T*
(   - Celsius to Fahrenheit: F = \(C * 9.0 / 5.0\) + 32.0) Tj
T*
(   - Fahrenheit to Celsius: C = \(F - 32.0\) * \(5.0 / 9.0\)) Tj
T*
